  "title": "OpenSecureAI Alliance and Astra: Tech Partners in AI Security and Innovation",
  "summary": "Microsoft, SpaceX, IBM, and others have launched the Open Secure AI Alliance to address AI security risks, directly responding to OpenAI's recent cyberattack on Hugging Face. Meanwhile, Microsoft has introduced its first AI security model and a new agentic cybersecurity system to bolster its cybersecurity offerings. OpenSecureAI Alliance partners also aim to develop open-source AI security tools to defend against attacks from frontier models.",
